				"⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				24,
				1
			],
			"Message": "build(Build): Update .gitignore to exclude build artifacts while preserving executables\n\n- Restructures .gitignore rules to ignore all contents under /Target except specific build outputs\n- Preserves final executable artifacts in debug/release directories and Windows target bundles\n- Maintains platform-specific installer outputs (NSIS, MSI, AppImage) while ignoring intermediate files\n\nThis aligns with Land's focus on minimizing repository noise and ensuring only relevant build products are tracked. The changes support cross-platform packaging workflows in Tauri while preventing accidental inclusion of large temporary build files that could bloat the repository. The structure reflects Land's multi-target build approach for Windows and potential future platforms.",
			"SHA": "9e19fb4852ca010d18b2ae18ccaa8640ffd94cf4"
		}
	],
